      pp_c3: 'If you choose to sign in with Google, Firebase Authentication may receive your email address and basic profile information such as your display name or profile photo when Google includes them in the credential. If you link an email/password account, that email is stored securely by Firebase Authentication. The App uses the email address for account linking and does not use or display the Google profile photo or display name.',
